# The exact subject binary (openssl.blind) IS committed, via Git LFS (see the repo-root
# .gitattributes: *.blind -> LFS). The OpenSSL static build is not byte-reproducible across
# toolchains, so the recorded bytes are pinned in LFS rather than rebuilt. Ignore only the
# build intermediates from build-openssl-fixture.sh (used for provenance/local comparison).
openssl.blind.unstripped
*.o
*.tar.gz
